# "From anywhere": Lightning Bolt goes from the stack to Bot1's graveyard as it finishes resolving, and the Ornithopter it
# destroyed (a creature card put into a graveyard from the battlefield, dying, CR 700.4) arrives in Bot2's. Both
# trigger the Void together and both are exiled, so neither graveyard holds a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Planar Void
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Swamp x3
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x6
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Planar Void.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Island
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 0
